fixture tech11_ember_far_wall
doc BUILD.md s6 Ember Toss "a 600 u/s projectile that stops on walls; press again to teleport to it": an ember stopped on the gorge's far wall face; the teleport fits the body beside it, and a cling and a kick climb out
room test/gorge
spawn 400 384
frames 160
input
  0..5 R
  # A full jump at the near edge, and the throw down-forward at its top.
  6..27 jump
  28 D R toss
  # Back on the near side, teleport once the ember has stopped on the far wall's face (736 u).
  80 toss
  # Hold toward the wall: cling, kick, and over the top onto the far ledge.
  81..99 R
  100 R jump
  101..159 R
end
expect
  at 28 event.toss=1
  mark stopped 31..79 ember=1 ember_x>=735u
  at stopped ember_y>390u ember_y<560u
  mark home 30..79 event.land=1
  at home x<480u
  # The body fits beside the wall, its centre half a width back from the ember.
  at 80 event.teleport=1 ember=0 x<=726u x>=724u
  mark cling 81..99 event.wall_cling=1
  at 100 event.wall_kick=1
  mark across 101..159 event.land=1
  at across y=384u x>736u
  never 0..159 event.hazard=1
end
